   * arrow `<button>`s inside this branch's own wrapping `<Link>` (invalid nested-interactive
   * HTML), let a "Next image" click bubble up and also fire this Link's own PDP navigation (a
   * real double-navigation bug), and concatenated every slide's own un-blanked `alt` text onto
   * the link's accessible name. `index.tsx` now never forwards `images` in this branch at all,
